<h1>Welcome to Sameer Kumar's Articles</h1>
<p>
  Sameer Kumar is a programmer, product builder, and founder. In 2020 he started <a href="https://shipblink.com">ShipBlink</a>, a shipping platform for e-commerce merchants, which he built and ran alone until it was acquired by <a href="https://www.easypost.com">EasyPost</a> in 2024, where he now leads product for the small and medium business shipping line. He also runs <a href="https://casparser.in">CASParser</a>, which parses and consolidates Indian investment records, used by wealthtech platforms including Scripbox, Dezerv, and 360One.
</p>
<p>
  Sameer lives in New Delhi and studied computer applications at Guru Gobind Singh Indraprastha University. He has traveled to over 35 countries, most recently spending six months backpacking through South America.
</p>
<p>
  Mostly active on <a href="https://twitter.com/sameer_kumar018">Twitter</a>. <br>Know more <a href="https://www.sameerkumar.website">here</a>.
</p>

